      "description": "Norbert BANHALMI is a Hungarian fine-art and applied photographer, executive portrait specialist, visual branding strategist, curator and photography educator. Active since 1999, he lives and works in Vienna and maintains professional ties to Budapest; his practice spans commissioned portraiture, brand and event photography, books, exhibitions, curatorial programmes and community education.",
